      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is the same kind of crashing I have been having since the update.  I wish we could go back from .30 to .29.  If I run the game in borderless fullscreen it happens more frequently.  Widowed ad exclusive full screen still seem to crash, but far less frequently.  I tested this with both my RX 6800 XT and on a GTX 1650 Super... same result.  Reistalled Windows, same result.",
